# --- Trained weights ------------------------------------------------------
# 44 MB each; ~12 of them. Not in git — every one is reproducible from the
# training script + seed recorded in its *_metrics.json. Ship them as a
# GitHub Release asset if they need to travel.
*.pt
*.pth
*.joblib
*.safetensors
*.bin

# --- Kept on purpose ------------------------------------------------------
# models/*_metrics.json and models/*.log ARE tracked: they are the evidence
# behind every number in the README and in TRAINING_LOG.md.
!api/models/*_metrics.json
!api/models/*.log

